<title>DENMARK: Oeresundsforbindelsen issues 500 mln DKK bond.</title>
<headline>Oeresundsforbindelsen issues 500 mln DKK bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond offer was announced on Wednesday by arrangers CIBC Wood Gundy and Nykredit Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - A/S OERESUNDSFORBINDELSEN</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 500 MILLION DANISH CROWNS</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>ISS DATE - FEBRUARY 25 1997</p>
<p>ISS PRICE - UNSTATED</p>
<p>MATURITY - NOVEMBER 15 2001</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - KINGDOM OF DENMARK</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
